        "description": "<p>Effect: The user's default ATK and SPD Stages are -4. After the user resolves an Attack, the user's default ATK and SPD Stage increase by +1 (managed by the Slow Start Clock). While Afflicted with @Affliction[grapple], the user gains +30 Lift and the user's @Trait[grapple] Attacks have a 30% chance to cause the @Affliction[grapple] target to lose @Tick[-1].</p>",
